    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="45.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 45.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be haligdæiges freolse. Gyf frigman freolsdæge wyrce, ðonne gebete he þæt mid his healsfange, ⁊ huru wið God bete hit georne, swa swa him man tæce.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the Sunday festival. If a freeman works during a church festival, he shall make amends for doing so by the payment of his healsfang, and especially he shall zealously make amends to God, according to the directions given him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gyf freoman freolsdæge wyrce, þonne gebete þæt mid his halsfange, ⁊ huru wið God bete hit georne, swa swa man him tæce.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
